When the input is a multi-turn session, and the model reasoning content for each turn is added to the request body, such as:

`{
    "model": "Qwen3",
    "max_tokens": 4096,
    "stream": true,
    "chat_template_kwargs": {
        "enable_thinking": true
    },
    "messages": [
        {
            "role": "system",
            "content": "你是一个具有主动服务意识的机器人"
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "AAA"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "reasoning": "BBB",
            "content": "CCC",
			"tool_calls": [{.....}]
        },{
		    "role": "tool",
			"content": "......",
			"tool_call_id": "a8feea294d33f5d9"
	    }
    ]
}` 

Even when using streaming output, think leakage still occurs, such as:

