The deployment command is as follows:
`vllm serve Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking --served-model-name Qwen3 --port 8084 --tensor-parallel-size 2 --enable-prefix-caching --quantization fp8 --gpu-memory-utilization 0.95 --reasoning-parser qwen3 --enable-auto-tool-choice --tool-call-parser hermes --trust-remote-code`

